{"id":"24d8686d42636bb7","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-sheaf-existence-and-uniqueness.md","title":"Theorem — 层的存在与唯一性分解","display":"Theorem — 层的存在与唯一性分解","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-sheaf-existence-and-uniqueness","aliases":["14-thm-sheaf-existence-and-uniqueness"],"display":"Theorem — 层的存在与唯一性分解","depends_on":["[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]","[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-sheaf-existence-and-uniqueness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-sheaf-existence-and-uniqueness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 层的存在与唯一性分解"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9135c45b14ec366c\" href=\"?note=9135c45b14ec366c\" title=\"14-df-j-sheaf-object\">14-df-j-sheaf-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" href=\"?note=1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" title=\"14-df-j-separated-objects\">14-df-j-separated-objects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce0c3e433ca617db\" href=\"?note=ce0c3e433ca617db\" title=\"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism\">14-df-j-dense-monomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,j,X\">\\(\\mathcal E,j,X\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9135c45b14ec366c\" href=\"?note=9135c45b14ec366c\" title=\"14-df-j-sheaf-object\">14-df-j-sheaf-object</a> 的结构声明；分离性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" href=\"?note=1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" title=\"14-df-j-separated-objects\">14-df-j-separated-objects</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl((\\operatorname{IsMono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\land\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j))\\Rightarrow\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,X)\\ \\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)\\ g\\circ m=f\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl((\\operatorname{IsMono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\land\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j))\\Rightarrow\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,X)\\ \\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)\\ g\\circ m=f\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：唯一存在等价于存在且任意两个解相等；分别应用于每个稠密单射和每个 f。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","status":"resolved","id":"9135c45b14ec366c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-separated-objects","status":"resolved","id":"1ff1b9c370bbaad1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"ce0c3e433ca617db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","status":"resolved","id":"9135c45b14ec366c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j,X$ 满足 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]] 的结构声明；分离性见 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-separated-objects","status":"resolved","id":"1ff1b9c370bbaad1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j,X$ 满足 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]] 的结构声明；分离性见 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E,j,X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\bigl((\\operatorname{IsMono}_{\\mathcal E}(m)\\land\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j))\\Rightarrow\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,X)\\ \\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)\\ g\\circ m=f\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1084,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-existence-and-uniqueness|Theorem — 层的存在与唯一性分解]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-215","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-existence-and-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-existence-and-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-existence-and-uniqueness|Theorem — 层的存在与唯一性分解]]"}],"outgoing":["9135c45b14ec366c","1ff1b9c370bbaad1","ce0c3e433ca617db"]}